      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-default-paladin",
      "parentSectionId": "section-classes-default",
      "heading": "Paladin",
      "sourceAnchor": "default-paladin",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-default-paladin-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Your best bet for a martial class. Stick to Blessed Warrior builds to capitalize on your Charisma increase."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-default-ranger",
      "parentSectionId": "section-classes-default",
      "heading": "Ranger",
      "sourceAnchor": "default-ranger",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-default-ranger-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Bad ability spread."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-default-rogue",
      "parentSectionId": "section-classes-default",
      "heading": "Rogue",
      "sourceAnchor": "default-rogue",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-default-rogue-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Bad ability spread."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-default-sorcerer",
      "parentSectionId": "section-classes-default",
      "heading": "Sorcerer",
      "sourceAnchor": "default-sorcerer",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-default-sorcerer-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The smallest hit die of any Charisma-based spellcaster, so Black-Blood\n\tHealing is exceptionally effective. You get plenty of skills to be a Face, and\n\tthere’s little else that you need to worry about. Since the Verdan were born\n\tof a chaotic entity, Wild-Blooded Magic seems like an obvious subclass, but\n\tdon’t feel like you absolutely need to go that route."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-default-warlock",
      "parentSectionId": "section-classes-default",
      "heading": "Warlock",
      "sourceAnchor": "default-warlock",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-default-warlock-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Great traits for any warlock, and Hexblades who fight on the front lines will\n\tfind Black-Blood healing very helpful."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
